# Level 5 (planet 5): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots twice and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. Walkers 13 and 14 with their heads, ground guns 12, 18 and 47, and
# their shots.
level 5
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
